ational text analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Zotero"},{"text":"Omeka"},{"text":"WordPress"},{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Voyant Tools"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted editing"},{"type":"p","text":"AI literacy is increasingly useful for editors."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to use AI for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"First-pass grammar checks"},{"text":"Style consistency"},{"text":"Summarisation"},{"text":"Metadata generation"},{"text":"Headline alternatives"},{"text":"Translation assistance"},{"text":"Content classification"},{"text":"Document comparison"},{"text":"Research organisation"},{"text":"Editorial QA"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But the editor remains responsible for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Copyright"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Cultural sensitivity"},{"text":"Bias detection"},{"text":"Source verification"},{"text":"Final editorial judgement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated text should never automatically be treated as fact."},{"type":"h","text":"High-value projects during the BA"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Before/After Editing Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Collect 10 pieces showing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Original","Edited version","Explanation of editorial decisions"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"Tone"},{"text":"Clarity"},{"text":"Fact-checking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Digital Magazine"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small online publication covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"History"},{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Society"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Heritage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use a CMS and maintain an editorial calendar."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Academic Editing Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Edit:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research abstracts"},{"text":"Academic essays"},{"text":"Literature reviews"},{"text":"Conference papers"},{"text":"Research reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate citation consistency."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Cultural Archive"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a digital archive containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Oral histories"},{"text":"Documents"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Descriptions"},{"text":"Keywords"},{"text":"Geographic information"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — SEO Editorial Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Take five existing articles and improve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Title"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"Headings"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Readability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — AI Editorial QA"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an experiment comparing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human editing","AI-assisted editing","Human final review"]},{"type":"p","text":"Document where AI helped and where it introduced errors."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Publishing"},{"text":"Copyediting + books + style guides"},{"text":"Senior/Managing Editor"}],[{"text":"Academic Editing"},{"text":"Research + citations + academic style"},{"text":"Academic Editor"}],[{"text":"Digital Publishing"},{"text":"CMS + SEO + web editing"},{"text":"Digital Editor"}],[{"text":"Cultural Publishing"},{"text":"Humanities + research + editing"},{"text":"Cultural Editor"}],[{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Reporting + fact-checking + editing"},{"text":"Senior News Editor"}],[{"text":"Magazine Editing"},{"text":"Features + commissioning + editing"},{"text":"Magazine Editor"}],[{"text":"Educational Content"},{"text":"Pedagogy + editing + curriculum"},{"text":"Content Editor"}],[{"text":"Technical Content"},{"text":"Research + documentation + editing"},{"text":"Technical Editor"}],